<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Th-that means...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was still alive when he found her...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then cutting off her head to finish her off, that was...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> kept his mouth shut.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"You're kidding, right!? Why'd you kill <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE>!? 
{PAUSE ""}
　And for 9 years on top of that...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> grabbed </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> by the shoulder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="3">, are you done with your deduction?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't look particularly shaken.</STYLE><PG>
"Quit messing around! Why'd you do this!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="4">, wait! Just because she was alive doesn't mean he finished her off..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"'Cause no matter how you look at it, the only one who could've finished her off is <STYLE ID="3">this guy</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> was </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="げきこう">enraged</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> still wasn't trying to say anything.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, may I keep asking questions?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>, what are you talking about!? What more is there to ask!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Please tell me a little more about when you found her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="6">, the culprit being </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is just a hypothesis. We haven't settled the 'setup' yet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Damn...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> let go of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and sank to the floor.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"When I found </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, huh... It'll take a little while, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said that and sat up straight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"At that moment, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was standing at the top of the cliff. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">When I found her, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was just about to jump off the cliff."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田崖.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Come back here, now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I called out, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned her tearful face toward me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, stay away! I... broke the </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Don't say such stupid things! </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't that narrow-minded!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No...! I've failed as one of the Arata people! There's no way I can be forgiven...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was talking with </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> doesn't mean to blame either of you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Really...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Really?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah! So come over here, now!"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">I slowly approached </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That was when it happened.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Suddenly, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> swayed and toppled over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ手を伸ばす.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n3000\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">As if drawn by something unseen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> slipped smoothly over just like that, and vanished below the cliff.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\渓流.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Frantic, I headed for the bottom of the cliff.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> probably knows this, but it takes at least 5 minutes to get from that cliff down to the bottom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I reached the bottom...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Even from a distance, I could tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was already gone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s head had already been severed from her body.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="10">"That's a lie! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
　There's no way something that convenient happened! <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> just swayed and toppled over right at that moment!? Quit messing around!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> stood up and lit into </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="4">, this story probably isn't a lie."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What, even you, <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"If this were a lie, he could just say she was already dead when he found her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Or say she jumped without being talked down. There's no need for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to go out of his way to lie here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Damn...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> sank to the floor again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... mind if I ask you a question too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh? Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
